<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Safari Zone!\rFor just ${STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}, you can play the\nSafari Game.\rYou can roam the wide-open Safari Zone\nand catch whatever you want.\fYou wanna play? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss!\nWelcome to the Safari Zone!\rFor just ${STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}, you can play the\nSafari Game.\rYou can roam the wide-open Safari Zone\nand catch whatever you want.\fYou wanna play? {YESNO 0}\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’ll be ${STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}, please!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight.\nCome back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here go your Safari Balls!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} Safari Balls\nfrom the attendant.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We’ll call you when you run outta\nSafari Balls.\fAight, have a good one!\rGo on, have fun!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You still got Safari Balls left.\nLeave the Safari Zone? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bet.\rHand over any Safari Balls you\ngot left.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You have fun?\nCome back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad.\nYou ain’t got enough bread.\rHope you slide back through.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss!\nYou ain’t got enough bread.\rHope you slide back through.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad.\nAin’t no room left in the PC!\rCome back after you\nclear some space.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss!\nAin’t no room left in the PC!\rCome back after you\nclear some space.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! This your first time at\nthe Safari Zone? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome, Boss!\nWant me to explain the Safari Zone? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Safari Zone, you play the\nSafari Game, where you get {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0}\fSafari Balls to catch homies.\rWhen you run outta Safari Balls,\nthe game over.\rWhen you see a homie, you can\nthrow Bait or Mud.\rThrow Bait, and homies usually stay\nbut get harder to catch.\rThrow Mud, and they easier\nto catch, but they might dip.\rHave fun at the Safari Zone!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Have fun at the Safari Zone!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Warden Baoba got somethin’ important\nto tell you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Area Customizer.\nWhat you wanna know about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Safari Zone got six Areas.\rPlains Area...\nPeak Area...\fand so on.\rThe Area Customizer let you\nswitch up the combo of Areas.\rWhat else you wanna know? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Check the machine, and you’ll see\nthe Area Customizer screen.\rThe bottom window show the current\nSafari Zone setup.\rPick an Area with the A Button to\nswap it with another one.\rWhat else you wanna know? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you pick an Area, then pick\nSwap, you’ll see 12 new Areas.\rHighlight one and\npress the A Button.\rWhat else you wanna know? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you pick an Area, then pick\nOrder, the Area type stay the same,\fbut you can move where it’s at.\rWhat else you wanna know? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Different Areas got different homies\nlivin’ in ’em, so when you switch\fAreas, you see different homies.\rDefinitely try different Areas!\nWhat else you wanna know? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but this can’t be used yet.\nWarden Baoba got a big plan for this\fmachine...or so he say. Even we\fdon’t know what it is. It’s a secret.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy the Area Customizer!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} turned on\nthe Area Customizer!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s still in the works.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, I been waitin’ on you!\nWhat you think?\rThis a brand-new Safari Zone.\nBy the way...\rI just had a idea.\nYou wanna take the Owner\fAptitude Test? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right on!\nLemme explain how the test work.\fIt’s real easy.\rAll you gotta do is catch one\nGEODUDE in the Safari and show me.\rThey in the grass closest to the\nentrance. Shouldn’t take long\fto catch one.\rGood luck!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, I never thought anybody\nwould say no!\rYou could be the Safari Zone Owner,\ndon’t you see?\rOwner...\nGot a nice ring to it, don’t it?\rYou should take the test! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, wonderful!\nYou caught a GEODUDE!\fYou passed the first test.\r..................\rHuh? I ain’t tell you there’s\ntwo tests?\rThat’s right!\nBecomin’ a owner ain’t that easy.\rThe second test is...\nWell, I’m still settin’ it up.\rI’ll let you know when it’s ready.\nYou just gotta wait a lil.\fI’ll call you on the Pokégear.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Show me the GEODUDE once you\ncatch one.\rThey in the grass closest to the\nentrance. Shouldn’t take long.\rGood luck!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been waitin’ on you!\nThe test ready.\rThis time, can you catch a SANDSHREW\nand show it to me?\rSound easy, right? Nope!\nSANDSHREW don’t show up with the\fcurrent Safari Zone setup.\rAnd that’s where this come in clutch!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This fancy, high-tech machine\nlet you customize Safari Zone Areas.\fI call it the Area Customizer!\rYou wanna know how it work,\ndon’t you?\fIt’s a...secret!\rNah, you shouldn’t have trouble\nworkin’ it. Just holla at the staff\fnext to me!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I almost forgot!\rI was in the middle of explainin’\nthe second test, wasn’t I?\rYou won’t see SANDSHREW\nwith the current Safari Zone Areas,\rso you gotta use the Area Customizer\nto switch ’em up.\rSANDSHREW live in the desert!\nGood luck!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You did it!\rYou caught a SANDSHREW!\nI knew you could do it.\rYou passed the test!\nYou the Safari Zone Owner now!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I always wanted to see young people\nplayin’ at the safari!\rI figured I’d get some new ideas.\nThat should help you finish your\fPokédex.\rThat’s what I been thinkin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, even though you the\nSafari Zone Owner now, could you\fkeep payin’ to get in?\fWe got our reasons.\rDon’t be mad. I’mma keep thinkin’ of\nnew fun ways to\fhelp you finish your Pokédex.\rGo have fun at the Safari Zone!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll hit your Pokégear as soon as I\ncome up with somethin’ new!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Show me the SANDSHREW once you\ncatch one. SANDSHREW live in the\fdesert! Good luck!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Slow down.\rOnce the next test ready, I’ll\ncall you on the Pokégear.\rGimme some time, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, I been waitin’ on you!\rI had a epiphany!\nA new attraction!\rI’mma call it...\nObject Arrangement!\rThis finna be fun!\nYou can put objects on the field as\fyou play in the Safari Zone!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not only that, but the kinds of\nhomies you see change dependin’\fon what objects you put down.\rAin’t that amazin’?\nI’ll call you on the Pokégear if\fanythin’ else come up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll explain Object Arrangement.\nYou wanna know anythin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll explain Object Arrangement.\nAsk me whatever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s mad objects you can put\nanywhere as you walk around the Safari\fZone, except on stairs and grass where\fhomies show up!\rAlso remember you can put\nup to 30 objects in a Area.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s easy to put objects down. All you\ngotta do is make sure the spot\fin front of you is clear.\rIf it’s empty, you can pick\na object.\rSome objects big and need a\nbig space.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna move a object, just\nwalk up to it and check it. Objects\fyou put down glow in the dark.\fThat help at night.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s mad different objects.\nOnes that look like grass, trees,\fboulders, water, and other\fstuff...\rTry puttin’ down different objects.\fThe number of objects in a Area\fshow up in the Area Customizer\fon the top screen.\rMore objects comin’,\n’cause I keep addin’ more.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The kinds of homies you see\nchange dependin’ on the kinds\fof objects you put down.\rThe Safari Zone change too at\nthat point. Try puttin’ down\fdifferent kinds of objects.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Watch out!\rOnce you swap Areas, all the\nobjects you put down get removed.\rYou wanna know anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hope you enjoy it!\nGo on, have fun!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Safari Zone!\rFor just $500, you can play the\nSafari Game.\rYou can roam the wide-open Safari Zone\nand catch whatever you want.\fYou wanna play? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’ll be ${STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0}, please!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight.\nCome back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here go your Safari Balls.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} Safari Balls.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We’ll call you when you run outta\nSafari Balls.\rAight, best of luck!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t got your homie’s\nSafari Zone.\fMy bad, but you can’t go in here.\rHolla at the attendant next\nto me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You still got time left. You sure\nyou wanna leave the Safari Zone?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bet.\rHand over any Safari Balls\nyou got left.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You have fun?\nCome back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad.\nYou ain’t got enough bread.\rHope you slide back through.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boss!\rThis the Safari Zone Link\nfront desk.\rYou can swap Safari Zones here.\rYou wanna link with your\nhomies and swap Safari Zones? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Safari Zone Link\nfront desk.\rYou can swap Safari Zones here.\rYou wanna link with your\nhomies and swap Safari Zones? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna save the game?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s already a save file.\nCool to write over it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Savin’...\nDon’t you DARE turn it off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved the game.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Decide which one of y’all\ngon’ be the group leader.\rThe other player gotta pick\n“JOIN GROUP.” {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick who you wanna swap\nSafari Zones with. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} to answer...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} sent back a “OK”!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} said, “Nah”...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna leave the group?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You left the group.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Waitin’ on your homie to hit you up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} answered!\rYou wanna swap Safari\nZones with {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A “OK” got sent\nto {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ’bout to get a Safari Zone.\nHold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Safari Zone!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Safari Zone Link is done!\rCome to the front desk\nnext to you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but this can’t be used yet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back soon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0135_D47R0101_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
